          "start": 511,
          "end": 534
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 3",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 539,
          "end": 549
        },
        {
          "text": "4",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 554,
          "end": 555
        },
        {
          "text": "Dowry Prohibition Act, 1961",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 563,
          "end": 590
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.48731154203414917
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Even the charge-sheet accepts that the appellant has been living abroad in Jamaica.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 592,
      "end": 675,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Jamaica",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 667,
          "end": 674
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2523368299007416
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The allegations against appellant in the charge-sheet read thus:\nOn that A-3 is living aboard in Jamaica country, A-3 is abusing in filthy language,\nand demanding the additional dowry to Lw-1 through phone calls, A-1 used to tell her to curse, beat Lw-1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 676,
      "end": 930,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Jamaica",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 773,
          "end": 780
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14926910400390625
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "A-1 seeing their support of A-2 to A-4 and torturing Lw-1 so much.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 931,
      "end": 997,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21145667135715485
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "A-1 to A-4 threatening to make you conscious and tell you where you are headed",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 998,
      "end": 1076,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": ", but all efforts went in futile.\nHence, the A-3 is living abroad in Jamaica country, when the A-3 came in India and serve notice to her after I will file the supplementary charge sheet against her. On the last date, we had directed the learned counsel appearing for the State to take instructions whether call records in support of the allegations against the appellant form part of the Reason: charge-sheet.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1077,
      "end": 1486,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Jamaica",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1146,
          "end": 1153
        },
        {
          "text": "India",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1184,
          "end": 1189
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1760518103837967
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Today, on instructions, the learned counsel appearing for the State makes a statement that the call records do not form part of the charge-sheet and what is recorded therein is only on the basis of the statement of the first informant as well as the other witnesses under Section 161 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1487,
      "end": 1811,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 161",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1759,
          "end": 1770
        },
        {
          "text": "Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1778,
          "end": 1810
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6056422591209412
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "In absence of the call records, further prosecution of the appellant will be nothing but abuse of process of law.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1812,
      "end": 1926,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6371335983276367
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Therefore, we quash and set aside the charge-sheet and Daram Alekya vs Daram Aparna on 9 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51072221/\n1 prosecution only as against the appellant in CC No.864/2022 pending before the Court of the learned Additional Judicial Magistrate of First Class, Kavali.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1927,
      "end": 2239,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Daram Alekya vs Daram Aparna",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1982,
          "end": 2010
        },
        {
          "text": "9 August, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2014,
          "end": 2028
        },
        {
          "text": "CC No.864/2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2130,
          "end": 2144
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "We make it clear that the observations made in this order are limited to the case of the appellant and no adjudication is made by this Court as regards the role ascribed to the other accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2240,
      "end": 2432,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.39534908533096313
    },
